#' (EGAnetLab), paired with network loadings, entropy fit, optional bootstrap 
#' stability of dimensions and items, optional redundancy analysis (UVA), and 
#' plain-language interpretation.
#' 
#' @param data .
#' @param vars .
#' @param reportLang .
#' @param corr .
